WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.067 --> 00:00:16.464
It was early in the afternoon.

2
00:00:16.465 --> 00:00:21.492
Kip was just waking up from a nap.

3
00:00:21.493 --> 00:00:29.145
He stretched his arms wide.

4
00:00:29.146 --> 00:00:32.181
Kip looked down at Bird's nest.

5
00:00:32.182 --> 00:00:39.984
Bird was still asleep.

6
00:00:39.985 --> 00:00:43.335
Kip looked up at the sky.

7
00:00:43.336 --> 00:00:45.738
He saw something in the air.

8
00:00:45.739 --> 00:00:51.305
It was a bird flying over the park.

9
00:00:51.306 --> 00:00:53.507
The bird was very big.

10
00:00:53.508 --> 00:00:59.842
"Oh no!" cried Kip.

11
00:00:59.843 --> 00:01:04.875
"Is that another hawk?"

12
00:01:04.876 --> 00:01:07.186
The bird was very loud.

13
00:01:07.187 --> 00:01:10.921
"Honk! Honk! Honk!" it cried.

14
00:01:10.922 --> 00:01:13.824
It was coming closer to the tree.

15
00:01:13.825 --> 00:01:19.852
And it was getting louder.

16
00:01:19.853 --> 00:01:30.183
"Bird!" cried Kip.

17
00:01:30.184 --> 00:01:33.455
"Bird!" cried the big, loud bird.

18
00:01:33.456 --> 00:01:35.616
"Bird?" said Kip.

19
00:01:35.617 --> 00:01:37.404
He was confused.

20
00:01:37.405 --> 00:01:40.538
Just then Bird woke up.

21
00:01:40.539 --> 00:01:43.834
"Goose!" called Bird.

22
00:01:43.835 --> 00:01:46.079
"Goose?" said Kip.

23
00:01:46.080 --> 00:01:49.035
Now Kip was even more confused.

24
00:01:49.036 --> 00:01:53.726
"Bird," said Kip. "Do you know this bird?"

25
00:01:53.727 --> 00:01:57.619
"Yes," said Bird.

26
00:01:57.620 --> 00:02:05.419
"She's my old friend, Goose!"
